Psalm 117

1 O práise the LÓRD, all you nátions;
accláim him, all you péoples!

2 For his mérciful lóve has preváiled over ús;
and the LORD’s fáithfulness endúres foréver.

Alleluia!

Glóry to the Fáther, and to the Són,
and to the Hóly Spírit:
as it wás in the begínning, is nów,
and will be for éver. Amén.
